      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a57cf9a84a6aa10980acf7c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息时间到~。",
      "source_fingerprint": "309f83c1ea61b13521ca6f9e120752aa5a4b04e4932330e1035bea11d201920b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7cab39dfd1ffdffdf2a86d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可惜了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "636a96a506d3ad51007741cd08d94f762fd93f461f9ec27417fe5896e1bc5ad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b14f098ad66a7ab3f1ee56be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1032fa16ba05cfae5db0e9f21364c3dac4fe545e47f7f6fbc54afd0f269209e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db499d042ddde56538dddf3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的奖励是这个哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2cd320655720e99fdb2a8fa68e1671a563697d39dee267d76bcc701452dda8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf0aa1f558edb9802abcd3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打起精神~~……不行啊~\r\n是努力过头了吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5d690f973b123bf5c86dbfec09421f3b75aefe6aad7185f12ebc78afa07648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cba91750c0e1f38bc9e21e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“要上喽”明明有这样的心情，\r\n身体却不听话……\r\n呜，真让人心急~……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b52898d35d100681c13f7dccbc6f7a0184a455d0e81f09a33142fbd4c9efdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155c604efc6bdbf80f2fb59b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳公公之力，充电完毕！\r\n随时准备着哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a348b9fb301782614b4a69f6dea56ee4e3cea4fe67d0d0b2575228dcd02f4ca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05e5da523f9c71dff909780a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有想尝试的训练，我都可以。\r\n不，请务必让我试试！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9364593d62f21c13626c56e78d6d8dd667b48cb1f721002d286b64acde2cea29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5729a2b9f7b687a4d44a6c63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能在比赛中迅速脱离集体的话，\r\n感觉会更容易取胜！\r\n朝着这个方向努力锻炼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27e4e7bc37b37a225911e9156abf0820e54a8eca0996a59093c4fd0d26133c23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48ad97ff31d3f746018f781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，感觉不错♪\r\n光靠平时的训练大概是不够的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3f4eebeded47dde53a1fcecb2da5bf8b3e7c41b6ac12d8cc94ddeb1466812d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8819c83089d959cedd5a0ee5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好啊~\r\n正是训练的好时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce7b6b86da1f7176f20aef844a3bd9539ee966076df85d656816fd8d4bef3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c5183bebba3a481e798cc9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多多训练，和憧憬的前辈们并肩作战。\r\n目标是，强大而华丽的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e565ba4cd5e8964f8d1945941cd0f2fbe5e89823ee2a5064dc4c1cc30fd63640",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b855b64460c199e60b0ef90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯诶？\r\n哇，对不起！我有点发愣了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e2d4d8dcc77bac402e2a4e6504505ae50d0a7da3f8d7b20a5b93d6961896ecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8085152f48beaec6a8d5ac3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气氛阴沉沉的……但是，\r\n训练还是要好好做呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a9e949f6716b28d3cdc9136d1002b50525366781d497a8c36034c3964857cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b2ca0d4384f57a313a0553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练，\r\n那个~……散步之类的……\r\n可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a66db5d94e0f10436293a7503ed3604ea06d2bd05b170f533a2cc549a4dc8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1fa825d8e5109c1c7dafdf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "动起来啊我~……\r\n这么不中用的话，\r\n可没脸面对后冠之名啊~",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6a801e46bb9f745e95e99e92ae9aaf5d346cb3bea9de85ebac66b07cad44c13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155da9b4feae490a39ef3154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢闪闪发光的比赛。\r\n但是现在却觉得赛跑很辛苦……\r\n很讨厌，明明不想这样的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a4af4dfedbe3119c1716ddefed7c1330eccc3a0787c5453a763430f54bd439b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bdfdae3d9a13e2b7604de4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以先休息一下吗……？\r\n我一定会复归，然后变得\r\n能挑战任何赛事的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9192ad06174a406bbfb62b65772a38c702622785a60b60fb527f313e7e38f4a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f695067c841cf6cce01287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火力全开！\r\n这是努力后的成果，\r\n我要充分地展现出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcb44917a048ba3ccb87238a3b8d5c9ba84eacd0393b92ca3c31f893e79cf14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:094110f41c40a71d46decf8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我，\r\n感觉能达成史上最速！\r\n跑出一场能被传颂的比赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "056a37f2a6c51642742614b7463f48ff3caedb2c43c5bade43177e79f5bb9d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20528e2a3418698298b359ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心里就像太阳一样熊熊燃烧着！\r\n这样的话能赢！一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a4edc8fc26fc8c42ac32445db05e43f3b03d178c707c65454814977c9e7aa9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2447be63b35ca59f461ed72d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉不错♪\r\n就以这样的气势，\r\n从一开始飞奔起来吧~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a02fc4d9c908d850e905bc122cb1fb0d4093c1f31f91ce78099a8bdc41d6df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f9123f2ce4503d1d476c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很好！\r\n接下来只要好好走自己的路就行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ca826a3e99ce227d6994a9f5091e4d23434fb187c6a250fe6e6485d36b968d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "20027"
      ]
    }
  ]
